title: A Merge Gate an Agent Can Call Needs a Stop Condition
description: A gate that answers PASS or FAIL was built for a person who reads the answer once. An agent reads it, edits, and calls again. Solumbe 4.12.0 counts those calls and tells the agent when to stop and ask.
